   "claims": [
    "Window AC Size Chart The chart below from Energy Star shows how many BTUs are needed for a given room size.[1] BTUs of cooling needed to condition various size rooms.",
    "Room Size (ft2) Capacity Needed (BTUs) 100 – 150 sq.",
